## 🆘 Troubleshooting

### Deployment Fails

```bash
# Validate configuration before deploying
make deploy-ci

# Check specific component
make deploy-preflight
make preflight-network
```

### Service Won't Start

```bash
# Check logs
make logs

# Check status
make status

# Try specific component deploy
make deploy-databases
make deploy-app
make deploy-proxy
```

### Out of Disk Space

```bash
make prune           # Safe cleanup
# or
make clean           # Aggressive cleanup (resets everything)
```

### Need to Rebuild

```bash
make build           # Rebuild all
make build-app       # Rebuild apps only
```

